OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto workers join
OL,4,Aprotest as unfair dismissal tribunal
OL,5,Abegins
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer staff at the video games firm
OL,8,Fbehind Grand Theft Auto have joined a
OL,9,Fprotest rally before the opening of an
OL,10,Femployment tribunal claiming they were
OL,11,Fsacked because they tried to unionise.
OL,13,FThe 23 claimants who were dismissed
OL,14,Flast year for what Rockstar Games
OL,15,Fcalled "gross misconduct" have taken
OL,16,Fthe gaming giant to court for unlawful
OL,17,Fdismissal.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
