OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto workers join
OL,4,Aprotest as unfair dismissal tribunal
OL,5,Abegins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Independent Workers' Union of Great
OL,8,FBritain (IWGB) claims the former staff
OL,9,Fwere penalised for discussing working
OL,10,Fconditions in a private online forum
OL,11,Fwhile working on the upcoming Grand
OL,12,FTheft Auto 6.
OL,14,FRockstar Games, one of the UK's largest
OL,15,Fgame developers, said it took action
OL,16,Fafter staff discussed confidential
OL,17,Finformation, including specific game
OL,18,Ffeatures, on a Discord channel that was
OL,19,Fnot private.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
